'''Inside a Dream''' (Korean: '''꿈속에서''' ''Kkumsogeseo'') is the ending theme for the Korean dub of ''[[M13|Pokémon—Zoroark: Master of Illusions]]''. It is performed by {{wp|Younha}}.

